{"id":"0e813c351e7893cc","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-l-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC L Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-l-cardinal — ZFC L Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-l-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-l-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-l-cardinal — ZFC L Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-l-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-l-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-l-cardinal — ZFC L Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (constructible universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\)</span> (ordinal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (bijection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LCardinal}\">\\(\\operatorname{LCardinal}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}l\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{LCardinal}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\in L\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\kappa,\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}l\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{LCardinal}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\in L\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\kappa,\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Since <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> contains every ordinal, this says exactly that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> has no bijection from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> onto a smaller ordinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d8adfba370086ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (constructible universe, see [[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}$ (bijection predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LCardinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}l\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\operatorname{LCardinal}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\in L\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\kappa,\\alpha)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1013,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2398","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-l-cardinal.md|58-df-zfc-l-cardinal]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["de47935b5769dd1e","1d8adfba370086ed","d583890235faf0d5"]}